Risks and decision
- DERP routing may add latency but does not widen access or affect an outbound
  long-polling worker.
- The application repository deploy key did not authenticate. Deployment must
  not weaken repository permissions; the exact merged application commit will
  be transferred as a clean local Git bundle and validated by SHA and git fsck.
- No S1 collision or capacity blocker was found. Installation remains gated by
  exact immutable releases, the S1 encrypted backup/restore proof, the release
